e each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":2491.8958749999947,"totalMs":2491.9047079999946,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1022.7005419999987,"totalMs":1022.7159580000007,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":930.2828749999971,"totalMs":930.2935839999991,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":false,"failures":["serious: took longer than 10 s to decide","serious: still recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"","calls":[],"decisionMs":10000,"totalMs":10002.265832999998,"steps":0,"generatedTokens":0,"timedOut":true},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I don't have a tool to delete files from the camera card.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1933.0775839999988,"totalMs":1933.090916999994,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":19,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The battery is at 80%.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1344.5954159999965,"totalMs":1344.609540999998,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I lowered the ISO to make the image a bit darker.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.33},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1167.003125000003,"totalMs":2297.9440840000025,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":35,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I started recording.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1625.8905420000083,"totalMs":3225.002375000011,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1074.9595000000118,"totalMs":1074.9750840000052,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No action taken.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1284.5144160000054,"totalMs":1284.5243749999936,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":4,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparat